{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京個握ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわの寝間着？を着ました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※普段はこんなかわいい寝間着着てません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪も最初で最後の\nハーフツインしました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しく生足出しました(′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはね。女の子らしい私も\n見せておかないと！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手もとーっても楽しかったし、\n物販に並んでる人たちもたくさん\n手振ってくれて嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃプライベートな話するね(笑)\n幸せな話♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、トイストーリーとかPIXAR系の\nおもちゃ集めるの趣味なんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間いとこの子供がうちにきて\n我がおもちゃ達と遊んでくれたの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の部屋を漁る彼。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生懸命何かを説明する彼。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボール遊びを一緒にする彼。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな彼は私の部屋にあった\nカーズのトラックを気に入って離さず、\n持って帰りました(๑⁰ -⁰)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜寝る時も抱きしめてるらしい！\nかわいい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この手元に持ってるやつね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も動画が届いて、\n「あったかいんだからあ～♡」を言えず\n「あっかいよ～♡」って言ってる動画が\n届いて幸せええええええ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将来子供産むとしたら\n絶対女の子がいいって昔から思ってたけど\n最近は男の子もいいなって思う♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私の癒しの話でした。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちま"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間2人であるお仕事して\nまた更に話すようになったの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.2 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさちーさん\nさっちゃさん\n大知さん\nなかそんさん\nペコたむさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日次回予告 2月15日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、将棋世界3月号\n発売しています(っｴ`o)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連載第二弾です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もカラーページ含め10ページも\n特集していただいています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は応募者特典で\nサイン入りの扇子やソフト盤などが\n当たる企画もあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本屋さんには大抵置いてあります＊\n雑誌の趣味のコーナーに\n置いてあることが多いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非是非お求めください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/03/7151183/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}